{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The clique expansion (Berge’s 2-section): every vertex, isolated ones included, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex-index order, and an edge between every two vertices that share a hyperedge, once,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with no self-loops. Edges ascend by (index of u, index of v), u the lower. Singletons and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"empty hyperedges add no edge. Lossy and quadratic: one hyperedge of k members is k(k − 1)\/2"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edges."}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"cliqueExpansion()","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Hypergraphs","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols10HypergraphP11HypergraphsE15cliqueExpansion19AdjacencyListModule010UndirectedgH0Vy6VertexQzGyF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cliqueExpansion","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:19AdjacencyListModule010UndirectedaB0V","text":"UndirectedAdjacencyList","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols10HypergraphP6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Hypergraphs\/HypergraphAlgorithms.swift#L142","fileName":"HypergraphAlgorithms.swift"},"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/graphprotocols\/hypergraph\/cliqueexpansion()"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/Hypergraph\/cliqueExpansion()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/document